Third-party software
--------------------
Nerviz does not bundle third-party libraries in this repository. It invokes, at run
time and from the project's own wrapper:

  - OpenRewrite core (Apache License 2.0) — run by `platform-upgrade`, never copied here.
  - Spring Initializr (start.spring.io) — queried for versions and the project archive.

Code generated into a project by Nerviz depends on libraries chosen by that project's
blueprint; each is under its own license, resolved by the project's build.
